precision; Toby is youthful vulnerability.\n3. Kinetic Rhythm: Keep sentence 
structures tight and breathless in action scenes.\n4. Anti-Literalism: Transpose
idioms naturally; never translate word-for-word.\n5. Inviolable Glossaries: 
Strictly adhere to the canonical terms below.\n6. Output ONLY the clean 
translation with all markdown and formatting intact.\n\n\nCANONICAL GLOSSARY 
(Strictly enforce these exact translations):\n# O.N.E. Canonical Glossary — 
Italian (it)\nOpen Networked Earth -> Open Networked Earth (Terra Aperta e 
Connessa)\nO.N.E. -> O.N.E.\nUsufruct -> Usufrutto\nUniversal Usufruct -> 
Usufrutto Universale\nSortition -> Sorteggio\nRotational Sortition -> Sorteggio 
a Rotazione\nClass 0 Invariants -> Invarianti di Classe 0\nThermodynamic 
Accounting -> Contabilità Termodinamica\nThermodynamic Balance -> Equilibrio 
Termodinamico\nHeretic's Commons -> Commons dell'Eretico\nCommunity Land Trust 
-> Community Land Trust\nEcological Carrying Capacity -> Capacità di Carico 
