Island -> Zug Island\nAegis-Apex -> Aegis-Apex\nMeridian -> Meridian\nBlackiron 
-> Blackiron\nMarcus Vance -> Marcus Vance\nElena Cruz -> Elena Cruz\nToby 
Morales -> Toby Morales\nMaya Lin-Mercado -> Maya Lin-Mercado\nRay Miller -> Ray
Miller\nKira Vance -> Kira Vance\nSully -> Sully\nCampbell -> Campbell\nLeo -> 
